# ── Per-user runtime state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The .template.json versions are committed; the runtime files are seeded
# on first launch (see server.mjs readState / readFlashcards). Once seeded,
# they hold the user's progress, attempts, and SR scheduling.
data/study-state.json
data/flashcards.json
data/sr-state.json
data/mistakes/
data/mocks/

# Per-user LLM config (provider choice, API key)
data/llm-config.json

# State backups created during migrations
data/*.bak
data/*.bak2
data/*.bak3
data/*.bak-*

# ── Generated cache that we DO want to ship ────────────────────────────────
# Mock-question banks, parsed practice exams, schemas etc. are kept under
# version control so friends get them out of the box, no Codex needed:
#   data/cache/mock-questions/    — AI-generated per-course question bank
#   data/cache/mock-toc/          — PDF outlines (codex-built)
#   data/cache/practice-exam/     — parsed mock papers + model answers
#   data/cache/questions/         — self-test question banks per chapter
#   data/cache/schemas/           — JSON schemas (committed)
# Nothing to ignore under data/cache/, but it's listed here so you know it's intentional.

# ── Node ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── Misc ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
.env
.env.local
/.claude/
